      "message": "Please add an acceptance test in `ChangeIT` (or `ChangeReviewersIT`) to verify the new behavior and prevent regressions:\n\n1. When non-voting reviewers are present on an open change, querying with `LABELS` excludes them from `label.all`, while querying with `DETAILED_LABELS` includes them.\n2. On multi-patchset changes where approvals are not copied, voters from earlier patchsets are excluded from `label.all` under `LABELS`, but included under `DETAILED_LABELS`.\n3. When approvals are copied to the current patch set (e.g. sticky approvals), verify they are properly included in `label.all` under `LABELS` via `cd.currentApprovals()`.",
